+
+# Task
+
+Implement JSON Pointer (RFC 6901) as `resolvePointer(document, pointer)`, exported from `src/index.ts`.
+
+## What was done
+
+- `src/index.ts`: `resolvePointer` splits the pointer into reference tokens, unescapes `~1` then `~0`,
+  and walks the document. It throws on invalid syntax or when the pointer does not resolve.
+- `test/pointer.test.ts`: RFC 6901 section 5 examples, escaping order, falsy values, invalid syntax,
+  unresolvable pointers, canonical array indexes, inherited properties.
+- Design choices are in the decision-log `dl-001`.
+- Tests run with `npm test` (Node 22 strips types).
